# Local-only Worker secrets. Copy to `.dev.vars` if you want model reranking locally.
# Leave unset to use the built-in retrieval baseline.

# OpenAI-compatible model server example, e.g. vLLM on Leonardo or a tunneled local server:
# MODEL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8001/v1
# MODEL_NAME=XCombinator/sft-fab-all
# MODEL_API_KEY=...
